nodecode-hud-teach is a rewrite of iamlukethedev's iamlukethedev/hermes-hud-teach:

  https://github.com/iamlukethedev/hermes-hud-teach
  commit 41741e4a970a8b32545ddd303f3fc4d0b965bd5f
